Smart Job Seeker Platform is an AI-powered career development, recruitment, and skill intelligence system designed to connect job seekers, HR teams, employers, mentors, and administrators within one integrated platform. Traditional job portals mainly focus on job posting and application submission, but they often fail to provide personalized guidance, resume evaluation, candidate-job matching, interview preparation, and intelligent recruitment support. This project aims to reduce that gap by combining job search, AI-based resume analysis, skill-gap detection, job-fit scoring, assessment generation, interview scheduling, real-time communication, and in-site video conferencing.

The platform allows HR and employers to post jobs with detailed criteria, required skills, responsibilities, salary range, eligibility, and selection stages. Applicants can create profiles, upload CVs, apply for jobs, and receive AI-generated scores based on how well their CV matches the job description. HR users can review applications, add remarks, shortlist candidates, assign aptitude tests, coding tasks, and writing tasks generated using Generative AI, and schedule interviews using Google Calendar integration. The system also supports AI-powered career recommendations, resume feedback, mock interview preparation, salary estimation, and fake job detection.

By using modern full-stack technologies, artificial intelligence, resume parsing, role-based dashboards, real-time communication, and secure OTP-based authentication, Smart Job Seeker Platform aims to make the recruitment process smarter, faster, more transparent, and more useful for both job seekers and recruiters.
